 are going with the mint breeze package, based on the amount of guests! \n\nAny advice or suggestions is MUCH appreciated!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1870504,"PostDate":1409835545,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello! I'm planning to marry my best friend on June 8th 2015! We are going with the mint breeze package, based on the amount of guests! <br>\nAny advice or suggestions is MUCH appreciated!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Xo, Macy","Email":"macyrollman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.153.2.106","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1409802705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MacyLyn","Id":279681,"Name":"MacyLyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.204.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e739c80c0fbb2a9aaa039f031dc23fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, MacyLyn and COngrats on your upcoming Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ve picked an amazingly beautiful wedding venue - as you can see in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured there recently.....with more at the album link here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152425657474487.1073741892.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/1800022_10152425661584487_3903449674349422246_o.jpg\" alt=\"1800022_10152425661584487_39034496743494\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10295938_10152425664324487_789239972802975750_o.jpg\" alt=\"10295938_10152425664324487_7892399728029\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870524,"PostDate":1409844281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, MacyLyn and COngrats on your upcoming Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You've picked an amazingly beautiful wedding venue - as you can see in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured there recently.....with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152425657474487.1073741892.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/1800022_10152425661584487_3903449674349422246_o.jpg\" alt=\"1800022_10152425661584487_39034496743494\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10295938_10152425664324487_789239972802975750_o.jpg\" alt=\"10295938_10152425664324487_7892399728029\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85448bc542e7701b504fc843fcd83ab1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am also getting married at the Barcelo in Riviera Maya, about a month before you (5\/15\/15). Any questions just ask. I have booked an outside photographer, and makeup\/styling team. My WC is Xhail. Our ceremony and reception will both be at Playa Azul (ceremony starts at 6pm). Looking forward to hearing from you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874263,"PostDate":1412475666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am also getting married at the Barcelo in Riviera Maya, about a month before you (5\/15\/15). Any questions just ask. I have booked an outside photographer, and makeup\/styling team. My WC is Xhail. Our ceremony and reception will both be at Playa Azul (ceremony starts at 6pm). Looking forward to hearing from you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410923588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.84.237.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92de9d62a772d14544c203f054626b75","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I love seeing so many brides choosing Barcelo! &amp;nbsp;We are getting married November 2015 at the Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe as well. &amp;nbsp;I haven&#039;t heard from a wedding planner yet, have you ladies? &amp;nbsp;If so I would love to hear about the process :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874327,"PostDate":1412546402,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I love seeing so many brides choosing Barcelo! \u00a0We are getting married November 2015 at the Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe as well. \u00a0I haven't heard from a wedding planner yet, have you ladies? \u00a0If so I would love to hear about the process <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stimaberry@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.212.163.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410094521,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GingerBride","Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ed6cb95b1a63feca9afcfaaf6ef0a60","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My wedding planner is Xhail. I have planned a lot so far. Are there specific questions you have?@[member=\"GingerBride\"] First you confirm your date by booking your reservations, thats when a WC will email you and you start planning.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874360,"PostDate":1412559572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My wedding planner is Xhail. I have planned a lot so far. Are there specific questions you have?@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279720\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279720-gingerbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GingerBride<\/span><\/a> First you confirm your date by booking your reservations, thats when a WC will email you and you start planning.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410923588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.102.222","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0f6c2b50e50cd35c320c42b7c389e39","RawContent":"@[member=\"cfinkenbine\"] we did confirm our date and time with the resort through our travel agent. Most of our guests have put their down payment for the trip. I&#039;m wondering if we have to put a down payment  with the resort for our package before hearing from the WC?  There is still a lot of time so I won&#039;t panic yet","Attachments":[],"Id":1874425,"PostDate":1412591299,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279867\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279867-cfinkenbine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cfinkenbine<\/span><\/a> we did confirm our date and time with the resort through our travel agent. Most of our guests have put their down payment for the trip. I'm wondering if we have to put a down payment  with the resort for our package before hearing from the WC?  There is still a lot of time so I won't panic yet \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stimaberry@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.212.163.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410094521,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GingerBride","Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"119f38aa97438b1ec207fb513fd7cd80","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes we had to put down a deposit before we were contacted by our WC. Our TA did all of that for us. We had to put down I think it was $150 for me, and $150 for my FI. I have tried to do everything as far ahead as time as possible so I do not have a lot to do and pay for when it gets close to our wedding. We have already bought my wedding dress, ring, and put our deposit down for our photographer and make up\/styling team.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874466,"PostDate":1412621057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes we had to put down a deposit before we were contacted by our WC. Our TA did all of that for us. We had to put down I think it was $150 for me, and $150 for my FI. I have tried to do everything as far ahead as time as possible so I do not have a lot to do and pay for when it gets close to our wedding. We have already bought my wedding dress, ring, and put our deposit down for our photographer and make up\/styling team.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410923588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.157.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"580fd48b4164e7993d95e8a0e69e580d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am with @[member=\"cfinkenbine\"] on spreading out paying for things. &amp;nbsp;I too already have my dress, and we have put down on a deposit on my ring (as soon as they get it in we will start payments for it) and our photographer. Next up is his ring and his outfit!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We had to put a deposit down with our travel agent to get our tour operator manifest and once we sent that to Tania at the Barcelo she confirmed our wedding date (instead of having it on hold) and then put us in touch with our wedding coordinator Lilian.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We too are doing the Mint Breeze package with our ceremony at Playa Azul and then our reception in one of the meeting rooms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Another suggestion if you havent done it already, is get an email address that is just for specific for your wedding. That is where all our communication with our travel agent, wedding coordinator and RSVP&#039;s will be directed to. This way you don&#039;t bog down your usual email account.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874468,"PostDate":1412621658,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am with @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279867\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279867-cfinkenbine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cfinkenbine<\/span><\/a> on spreading out paying for things. \u00a0I too already have my dress, and we have put down on a deposit on my ring (as soon as they get it in we will start payments for it) and our photographer. Next up is his ring and his outfit!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We had to put a deposit down with our travel agent to get our tour operator manifest and once we sent that to Tania at the Barcelo she confirmed our wedding date (instead of having it on hold) and then put us in touch with our wedding coordinator Lilian.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We too are doing the Mint Breeze package with our ceremony at Playa Azul and then our reception in one of the meeting rooms.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Another suggestion if you havent done it already, is get an email address that is just for specific for your wedding. That is where all our communication with our travel agent, wedding coordinator and RSVP's will be directed to. This way you don't bog down your usual email account.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412130898,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c359b9d184cb32c6116a21f58af22358","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I should have done that with my email! Great advice! I did make a separate email, but I made it after the fact of already emailing all sorts of vendors and guests!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874473,"PostDate":1412623343,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I should have done that with my email! Great advice! I did make a separate email, but I made it after the fact of already emailing all sorts of vendors and guests!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410923588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.233.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0038fc6024a4457a81f383489e82fe8a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Moments That Matter\" post=\"1870524\" timestamp=\"1409844281\"]\nWelcome to our forum community, MacyLyn and COngrats on your upcoming Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding!!!\n\nYou&#039;ve picked an amazingly beautiful wedding venue - as you can see in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured there recently.....with more at the album link here: [url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152425657474487.1073741892.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3\"]Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding[\/url]\n\n[img]https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/1800022_10152425661584487_3903449674349422246_o.jpg[\/img]\n\n[img]https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10295938_10152425664324487_789239972802975750_o.jpg[\/img]\n\nWishing you all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)[\/quote]Hi great photos! just wondering where this ceremony is on the resort?  I&#039;ve stayed at this resort and the beach although very beautiful did not seem very private for a ceremony and I&#039;ve seen other pics of ceremonies at barcelo that looked quite private but not sure what area of the resort complex it is?\nthanks","Attachments":[],"Id":1874697,"PostDate":1412754419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Moments That Matter, on 04 September 2014 - 07:24 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Welcome to our forum community, MacyLyn and COngrats on your upcoming Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You've picked an amazingly beautiful wedding venue - as you can see in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured there recently.....with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152425657474487.1073741892.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/1800022_10152425661584487_3903449674349422246_o.jpg\" alt=\"1800022_10152425661584487_39034496743494\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10295938_10152425664324487_789239972802975750_o.jpg\" alt=\"10295938_10152425664324487_7892399728029\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi great photos! just wondering where this ceremony is on the resort? \u00a0I've stayed at this resort and the beach although very beautiful did not seem very private for a ceremony and I've seen other pics of ceremonies at barcelo that looked quite private but not sure what area of the resort complex it is?<\/p>\n<p>thanks<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#cc6666;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"><em>Forever can never be long enough for me, to feel like I've had long enough with you...19\/01\/2016<\/em><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kimberlydiana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.76.172.36","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412304687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280238.png?_r=1412619945","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":60,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kimmyd2","Id":280238,"Name":"kimmyd2","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77947","Title":"Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe 2015","LastPostDate":1433390120},"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
